      {
        "y": 68.6,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "96.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 465.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Answer these questions about the associations discussed on the opposite page."
      },
      {
        "y": 87.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 354.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Would you recommend a cowboy plumber to a friend?"
      },
      {
        "y": 99.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 527.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Would a politician be more likely to be called a dove if they were a peacemaker or if they argued"
      },
      {
        "y": 111.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 206.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "for military action?"
      },
      {
        "y": 123.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 475.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 What is more likely to be a scar on the landscape – a waterfall or a factory chimney?"
      },
      {
        "y": 135.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 322,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Would you be pleased to be called a diamond?"
      },
      {
        "y": 147.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 306.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Would you be pleased to be called a hawk?"
      },
      {
        "y": 159.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 438.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 In Britain would you be likely to see a black cat on a good luck card or not?"
      },
      {
        "y": 171.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 402.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 What characteristic is a dog most typically said to have in English?"
      },
      {
        "y": 183.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 340.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 Would you be likely to call a business Supersharks?"
      },
      {
        "y": 199.9,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "96.2"
      },
      {
        "y": 202.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 494.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Match the colours with their associations in English. Are any of these the same in your"
      },
      {
        "y": 214.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 451.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "language? (See Unit 65 for more about the associations of colour in English.)"
      },
      {
        "y": 231.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 434.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 purple 4 red a purity d inexperienced"
      },
      {
        "y": 243.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 405,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 green 5 white b evil e danger"
      },
      {
        "y": 255.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 413.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 yellow 6 black c royalty f a coward"
      },
      {
        "y": 271.2,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "96.3"
      },
      {
        "y": 273.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 476.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Are these statements about the associations of animals in English correct? When a"
      },
      {
        "y": 285.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 249.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "statement is wrong, correct it."
      },
      {
        "y": 302.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 409.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 If you say someone has a dog’s life, you think they have an easy life."
      },
      {
        "y": 314.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 329.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 If you call a businessman a snake, you trust him."
      },
      {
        "y": 326.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 487.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 If you say someone’s hair is mousy, you mean it is dark brown and strikingly attractive."
      },
      {
        "y": 338.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 383.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 If you say someone is being ratty, you mean they are irritable."
      },
      {
        "y": 350.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 392.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 If you say someone can be catty, you mean they tend to be lazy."
      },
      {
        "y": 362.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 355.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 If you say something is fishy, you mean it is suspicious."
      },
      {
        "y": 374.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 439,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 If you call someone a sheep, you mean they are very independent-minded."
      },
      {
        "y": 386.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 450.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 If you say that someone is hawk-eyed, you mean that they have very big eyes."
      },
      {
        "y": 402.6,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "96.4"
      },
      {
        "y": 405.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 492.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Can you make any associations between the colours in 96.2 and the animals and their"
      },
      {
        "y": 417.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 473.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "associations in 96.3 that will help you to understand why these associations have"
      },
      {
        "y": 429.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 169.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "been made?"
      },
      {
        "y": 449.9,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "96.5"
      },
      {
        "y": 452.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 496.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some of these have associations of good luck in English and some have associations of"
      },
      {
        "y": 464.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 434.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "bad luck. Decide whether each picture represents good luck or bad luck."
      },
      {
        "y": 491.7,
        "x0": 171,
        "x1": 499,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Friday 13th a horseshoe walking under a ladder a four-leaved clover"
      },
      {
        "y": 596.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 427.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 2 3 4"
      },
      {
        "y": 616.9,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "96.6"
      },
      {
        "y": 620.2,
        "x0": 127.7,
        "x1": 208.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Over to you"
      },
      {
        "y": 644.4,
        "x0": 128.7,
        "x1": 486.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Write down five colours and five animals. What are your own associations for these words?"
      }
    ],
